@mcp = https://localhost:7243
@accessToken = replace-with-a-valid-mcp-access-token
@workspaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@headCommit = replace-with-current-commit-id

### OAuth protected resource discovery
GET {{mcp}}/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/mcp

### Discover tools (stateless Streamable HTTP)
POST {{mcp}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-03-26
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### Read a workspace directory
POST {{mcp}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-03-26
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"workspaceId":"{{workspaceId}}","path":""}}}

### Write a document using the current HEAD
POST {{mcp}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-03-26
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"put_document","arguments":{"workspaceId":"{{workspaceId}}","path":"example.md","expectedHead":"{{headCommit}}","content":"Example"}}}
